  "body": "<div><p>I design stuff when I am self soothing. </p><p>Some people knit. I do graphic design. It’s my thing. </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/22bdabf95d-25628635_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4><a href=\"https://www.teepublic.com/user/wearablepsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Behold! The Super Stage Parent Series</a></h4></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n<div><p>I was thinking about all of the jobs a parent of a child actor has to do and it humbled me for a moment. I thought these badass mom and dads need to be called out for their contributions. Yeah the momager and stage mom type gets a bad name. We can reclaim that. </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/053bdd2b73-25628536_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4><a href=\"https://www.teepublic.com/user/wearablepsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Super Mom Shirts</a></h4></div>\n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n<div><p>A stage parent who edits video, masters lighting, reads for self tapes, researches projects and is an acting coach - Impressive. </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/11ac0cc9f8-25628450_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4><a href=\"https://www.teepublic.com/user/wearablepsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SUPER STAGE DAD, TOO</a></h4></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n<div><p>A stage parent who is a Publicist, Contract Negotiator, Rejection Therapist and Motivational Speaker - Wow. </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/73520e4bfa-25628491_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4><a href=\"https://www.teepublic.com/user/wearablepsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Find Your Own Version</a></h4></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n<div><p>Let us not forget they are also spiritual counselors as well as hair stylists and the whole darn wardobe department. </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/1a37f73cca-25626537_1.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4><a href=\"https://www.teepublic.com/user/wearablepsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Super Stage Mom choices for days</a></h4></div>\n    \n    \n  \n\n<div><p>And most importantly they serve as President of their Child Actor’s Fan Club!</p><p>Check out some of these fun designs and more acting related wear </p></div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/db07c259be-21524387_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4>Official Merch</h4></div>\n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n  \n  \n  \n  <img src=\"/blog/images/7a8c7bc2b6-21463940_0.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  \n  \n    <div><h4>Actor Shirts</h4></div>"
